  "2026-08-07T18:14:55.950Z","harness:codex","Start 2026-08-07: prerequisite pm-x4nn3z is live-verified closed. All-status search confirms pm-hqa8g1 is the canonical command exit/effect contract; adjacent pm-f05lsg owns recovery closure and pm-srns owns broad SDK hardening. Active scope is generated per-command exit contracts, effect semantics, replay conformance, CLI contracts output, and scripting docs."
  "2026-08-07T18:18:09.758Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence: isolated process acceptance test expected update-many with zero matches to return exit 6 plus a no_effect receipt, but current CLI returned 0. The test also specifies distinct partial_effect=7 and full effect=0 behavior for update-many and close-many."
  "2026-08-07T18:29:50.326Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: introduced stable exits 6=no_effect and 7=partial_effect; generated declarations cover every core command; pm contracts --command update-many --full exposes vocabulary and [0..7]; CLI output only honors declared exits; telemetry treats 0/6/7 as successful; isolated real-process replay verified update-many and close-many full/no/partial effects. Focused TDD and projection suite: 10/10 passed."
  "2026-08-07T18:33:24.929Z","harness:codex","Closure evidence: linked suite passed 10/10 in an isolated schema tracker; contracts snapshot current; SDK public surface current with an explicit reviewed compatibility acknowledgment; docs link gate passed; full real-process output verified command_exit_contracts for update-many."
  "2026-08-07T18:44:48.409Z","harness:codex","Full-suite correction evidence: the initial 6961-test coverage run exposed four intentional contract assertions. Moved the new SDK module into sdk/cli-contracts to restore the 120-file directory cap; updated canonical 0-7 mapping; partial close now asserts exit 7; an all-row strict-validation failure now exits 5 dependency_failed rather than being mislabeled successful no_effect. Focused regression set passes 98/98 and SDK surface is current."
  "2026-08-07T19:40:42.068Z","harness:codex","Final local acceptance evidence: packed @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.8.7 into an unrelated temporary workspace; npx and bunx both reported 2026.8.7; init/create/TOON get/full contracts and SDK subpath import passed; real update-many returned 6/no_effect for zero matches and 7/partial_effect for one real plus one missing id. Repository coverage is exact 100/100/100/100 across 6966 tests; contracts, SDK surface, package artifact, security scans, changelog, and deterministic lint gates passed."
